From 8a23bf06881c8da068a946b90f81ee62d0a6ecfa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Javier Maestro <jjmaestro@ieee.org>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 12:04:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] patch: build the gb18030_and_gbk conversion under meson

IvorySQL 5.0 ships the gb18030_and_gbk conversion source
(src/backend/utils/mb/conversion_procs/gb18030_and_gbk/gb18030_and_gbk.c) and the
catalog registers the conversion, but the meson conversion_procs/meson.build omits
gb18030_and_gbk from its encodings map, so the .so is never built on the meson
path; opr_sanity then fails because the cataloged conversion has no loadable
conproc. The autoconf+make conversion_procs/Makefile already lists it. Add it to
the meson map so the conversion builds, matching make.

Backport of IvorySQL PR #1180 (which adds the same line to meson and also forces PG
mode for the meson test initdb template; only the conversion hunk is needed here).

References: https://github.com/IvorySQL/IvorySQL/pull/1180
---
 src/backend/utils/mb/conversion_procs/meson.build | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/backend/utils/mb/conversion_procs/meson.build b/src/backend/utils/mb/conversion_procs/meson.build
index 0e8273e0b6..436e2dd34e 100644
--- a/src/backend/utils/mb/conversion_procs/meson.build
+++ b/src/backend/utils/mb/conversion_procs/meson.build
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@ encodings = {
     'euc_tw_and_big5/euc_tw_and_big5.c',
     'euc_tw_and_big5/big5.c',
   ],
+  'gb18030_and_gbk': ['gb18030_and_gbk/gb18030_and_gbk.c'],
   'latin2_and_win1250': ['latin2_and_win1250/latin2_and_win1250.c'],
   'latin_and_mic': ['latin_and_mic/latin_and_mic.c'],
   'utf8_and_big5': ['utf8_and_big5/utf8_and_big5.c'],
